@@ -100,6 +100,20 @@ Start the server
   pnpm run dev
 ```
 
+## Task CSV exports
+
+Select tasks and use **Export tasks** in the bulk actions toolbar to download a CSV.
+The export includes selected tasks across pages that match the current filters,
+in the current sort order. It always contains `id`, `title`, `status`, `label`,
+and `priority`, including fields hidden in the table, and preserves your selection.
+
+Files use UTF-8 with a BOM for spreadsheet compatibility. Titles retain their full
+text, including commas, quotes, and line breaks. Formula-like values receive a
+leading apostrophe so spreadsheet programs can treat them as text; that prefix
+is part of the exported value. Spreadsheet applications may change this protection
+when editing and saving the file again. The existing Import dialog is still a demo,
+so CSV round-trip import into this dashboard is not implemented.
+
 ## Sponsoring this project ❤️
 
 If you find this project helpful or use this in your own work, consider [sponsoring me](https://github.com/sponsors/satnaing) to support development and maintenance. You can [buy me a coffee](https://buymeacoffee.com/satnaing) as well. Don’t worry, every penny helps. Thank you! 🙏
